Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,===================== XXX =====================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准看！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體變得好醜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且為何這麼臭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有種腐爛的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是貓怪的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正面目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真噁心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夾…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被看到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了 這下全完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:03:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是被貓怪附身的他隱藏著的另一個面目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有被貓怪附身的人才會變成那種異形
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氣味很噁心嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得害怕嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夾…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本田透？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼會在這裡淋雨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真慘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真狼狽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解草摩家什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道詛咒真正的可怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所能活的日子已經不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是注定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把十二生肖的詛咒一手包下來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到底對你期待什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道認為你能救草摩家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果你還不是如此狼狽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情不會這麼結束的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然像你這樣的女孩介入了草摩家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就要讓你更後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慊人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你啦 害我淋得跟落湯雞一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以為是你的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道卻…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 算了吧 不然你也會完蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由希你為何不追出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你現在討厭阿夾了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本來就討厭那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然他是貓 我是老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們互相厭惡的關係就不會有所改變
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那到底是誰準備好的藉口呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真叫人難過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樂羅你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼不去追阿夾？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不追
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管阿夾變成什麼樣子我都會接受他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為沒有人比我更愛阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我很明白的 我追去也沒有用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的阿夾只有小透能救他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樂羅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被同樣身為十二生肖的我所接受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對阿夾來說只是種安慰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我和阿夾太親近了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只好拜託小透救他了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？奇怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:11:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿夾的顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子連哭都沒哭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是自己的母親死了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當初沒生這個被貓怪附身的孩子就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不會因為過度憂鬱而死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴 不是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:27.21,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面 我叫做草摩籍真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的錯…不是我的錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 我都了解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我一起生活？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看我這樣子 我可是空手道道場的老師喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你也有興趣那就一起來學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 是阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,籍真真的要收養他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算他父親沒能力帶他 但這樣籍真實在太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 還這麼年輕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然要幫人帶一個被貓怪附身的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後你要多吸一些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高處的空氣才行喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 你是"師父"吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:14:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電視上都稱呼空手道的老師為"師父"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你也是師父吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許你說得對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我的門生倒是沒人這樣子叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在鬥志上我是不輸給老師的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆都進步很多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎 聽到您這麼說 我真的好高興
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 老師…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦 阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼老要用暴力來解決事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方只不過是嘲笑你的髮色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的父親來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說是他的養父 到底是怎麼教他的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然會收養一個被貓怪附身的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看籍真一定是瘋了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師父才不是我老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:14:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高一點的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦 阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我是想贖罪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祖父和阿夾一樣都是被貓怪所附身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家族的人都疏遠他還到處中傷他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害他一直過得很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和祖父只見過一次面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來 籍真
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我給你點心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要 不然會被詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當時我說了很殘忍的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑著原諒了我的無禮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是一個那麼好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後來祖父去世 我也長大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以第三者的身分看到阿夾的處境
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然感到一陣痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人的愚蠢、殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有行為都和我們以前沒兩樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要跟我一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了贖罪 我收養了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許我是想藉此來消除自己的罪惡感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起生活 朝夕相處
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對他產生了愛憐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次看到滿臉笑容的他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對他的愛就越深
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越來越重視他、擔心他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越希望他能得到幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直就像個父親的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我無視他的心情搶了他的念珠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬要他接受我的作法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又不是我的老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼突然要過來呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道不能明天和小透一起來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不自覺的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是電波啊？算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日子一定會嚇一跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到我們居然半夜…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡幹嘛 全身都淋濕了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小魚…和小花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒資格回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本來就沒資格待在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹嘛啊 花島
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不能去抱小透 電波是這麼告訴我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你應該去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非去不可
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 花島
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花島
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走 你快走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有非作不可的事 不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊 花島
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們什麼忙也幫不上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一能做的就是叫你去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.59,0:20:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你快點去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事啊！
